**/target/
**/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
*.class
*.log
hs_err_pid*

# Angular / Node.js
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/coverage/
**/.cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
